# Build context for backend/Dockerfile is the REPO ROOT (not backend/), because
# the API embeds knowledge/data/profile.json (include_str!) — the canonical
# profile data shared with the WASM core. Keep the context small: only backend
# sources, backend/.sqlx, and knowledge/ are actually copied into the image.
**/.git
**/target
**/.env
**/node_modules
**/dist
web
crates
docs
scripts
.github
backend/tests
*.md
